n": "JP", "source": "OTHER", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": []}, {"id": 117968, "title": {"romaji": "Jataka Monogatari: Kiniro no Shika", "english": null}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "A long time ago, an Indian princess dreamed of a golden deer singing in a beautiful voice. Seeing the king's treat, a boy sets a trap in the mountain. But when he sees what the trapped deer has done for his friends, he decides to let the deer go.  \n<br><br>\nThe 24th Tokyo Educational Film Contest Silver Prize\n<br><br>\n(Source: Gakken)", "startDate": {"year": 1969, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 1969, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 11, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "OTHER", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Fantasy"], "tags": []}, {"id": 117973, "title": {"romaji": "Doubutsu Mura no Kodomo-tachi", "english": null}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "Animal Village has built some roads with a lot of cars running through. In order to keep everyone safe, traffic rules were put into place.", "startDate": {"year": 1969, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 1969, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 21, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Slice of Life"], "tags": []}, {"id": 118048, "title": {"romaji": "Umihiko Yamahiko", "english": null}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "Long, long ago there were two brothers, named Umihiko and Yamahiko. The older brother, Umihiko, made his living catching fish in the sea. The younger brother, Yamahiko, made his living hunting birds and animals in the mountains.\n<br><br>\nOne day Yamahiko said to Umihiko, \"Why don't we exchange my bow and arrows for your fishing tackle, and trade places?\" After bothering him enough Umihiko agreed. The next day proved treacherous as they were unskilled. Umihiko hurt his arm and Yamahiko lost the fishing hook. Umihiko was extremely angered that Yamahiko's trade caused him to loose his prized hook, so even when his arm heals he'd never be able to fish again the same. Yamahiko strives to right his wrongs.", "startDate": {"year": 1968, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 1968, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 18, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "OTHER", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Fantasy"], "tags": []}, {"id": 118050, "title": {"romaji": "Kitakaze no Kureta Table-kake", "english": null}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "Based on a Norwegian fable.<br><br>Hans was making bread and North Wind was blowing all the flour out of his bowl. He decides to visit the North Wind in his castle to ask him to stop and for compensation. North Wind gives him a tablecloth that summons delicious food on top of it. Unbeknownst to him, Hans was swindled out of his tablecloth by a local innkeeper. He returns to North Wind and gets a sheep that drops gold coins. The innkeeper swindles him again. Hans returns a 3rd time and gets a scepter, this time booby-trapped by North Wind to figure out who has been stealing Hans' gifts. The innkeeper gets his punishment when he tries to swindle the scepter and Hans gets to keep his 3 fantastical items and returns home to his mother.", "startDate": {"year": 1967, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 1967, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 15, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "OTHER", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Fantasy"], "tags": [{"name": "Stop Motion", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 118118, "title": {"romaji": "Norakuro Ittouhei", "english": null}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": null, "startDate": {"year": 1935, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 1935, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 10, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "MANGA", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": []}, {"id": 118119, "title": {"romaji": "Norakuro Nitouhei", "english": null}, "format": "MOVIE